{
"#name"
:
{
"skill0"
:
null
,
"cn"
:
"通过方法论、数据/行为最佳约定，用于激发 LLM 潜力的种子 skill 集合及管理工具"
,
"en"
:
"Seed-skill collection and management tool — methodology + best conventions to unleash LLM potential"
}
,
"#synopsis"
:
[
"x skill0 <subcmd> [args]"
]
,
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"skill0 是一类特殊的 skill ， 被设计为零号 skill. skill0 聚集在各领域的元知识，包含最佳实践 + 数据/行为约定（如 rule、score）. 我们减少信息密度，并敦促 LLM 通过工具来根据当前环境，从一手文档，网络，skill 社区实时获取（例如 x rfc , x cve, x wkp，agent-browser 等 工具)，建立在理解的前提下执行，并形成最适合的个性化 skill 集合以及记忆体。\n"
,
"en"
:
"Skill0 is a special class of skill, designed as the zero-skill. It aggregates meta-knowledge across domains, including best practices + data/behavioral conventions (e.g., rule, score). We reduce information density and urge the LLM to use tools to fetch in real time from first-party docs, the network, and the skill community based on the current environment (e.g., x rfc, x cve, x wkp, agent-browser), execute based on understanding, and form the most suitable personalized skill set + memory.\n"
}
,
"#tip"
:
[
{
"en"
:
"General skills provide latest operational guides, data, knowledge, and methodology (rich content, but may not be continuously updated). Skill0 aggregates meta-knowledge across domains (best practices + data/behavioral conventions, e.g., rule, score), carries less (by design), and urges the LLM to use the right tools (x wkp / x rfc / x cve, browsers, search engines, etc.) to fetch the latest knowledge and the practices most suited to the current environment.\n"
,
"cn"
:
"一般 skill 提供最新的操作指南、数据、知识、和方法论（内容丰富，但不一定会不断更新）。 skill0 聚集各领域的元知识（最佳实践 + 数据/行为约定，如 rule、score），装得少（设计如此），敦促 LLM 用合适工具（x wkp / x rfc / x cve、浏览器、搜索引擎 等）取最新知识，及当前环境最适合的实践。\n"
}
,
{
"en"
:
"The LLM continuously updates its training data, methodology, and chain-of-thought, but data hallucinations have no solution — you can't expect it to be lossless compression. Community and personal skills may be outdated or have security issues.\nThe idea: leverage the LLM's continuously-updating ability to read external skills; once understood, verify via first-party data + formal logic given the current environment, and form a personalized skill set + memory.\n"
,
"cn"
:
"LLM 持续更新训练数据、方法论、思维链，但数据幻觉无解 — 难以指望 LLM 是无损压缩。社区、个人 skill 可能不更新，或有安全问题。\n理念是：发挥 LLM 不断更新的能力，阅读外部的 skill ，在理解的前提下按当前环境用一手数据 + 形式逻辑求证，形成适合自身的 skill + 记忆体。\n"
}
]
,
"#tldr"
:
[
{
"cmd"
:
"x skill0 ls"
,
"cn"
:
"列出所有 sub-skill"
,
"en"
:
"List all sub-skills."
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x skill0 ls --tsv"
,
"cn"
:
"TSV 输出，便于后续处理"
,
"en"
:
"TSV output for downstream processing."
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x skill0 which ccal"
,
"cn"
:
"解析 ccal 的 SKILL.md 路径"
,
"en"
:
"Resolve ccal to its SKILL.md path."
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x skill0 which data/ccal"
,
"cn"
:
"用 bucket/slug 形式"
,
"en"
:
"By bucket/slug form."
}
]
,
"ls"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"列出 skill0 catalog。TTY 表格，管道 TSV。"
,
"en"
:
"List skill0 catalog. Table on TTY, TSV on pipe."
}
,
"--tsv"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"强制 TSV 输出"
,
"en"
:
"Force TSV output."
}
}
,
"--csv"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"强制 CSV 输出"
,
"en"
:
"Force CSV output."
}
}
,
"--auto"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"默认（TTY 表格 / 管道 TSV）"
,
"en"
:
"Default (TTY table / pipe TSV)."
}
}
,
"#tldr"
:
[
{
"cmd"
:
"x skill0 ls"
,
"cn"
:
"默认输出"
,
"en"
:
"Default output."
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x skill0 ls --tsv"
,
"cn"
:
"TSV 输出"
,
"en"
:
"TSV output."
}
]
}
,
"which"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"把 sub-skill 名解析为绝对路径。"
,
"en"
:
"Resolve a sub-skill name to its absolute path."
}
,
"#1"
:
{
"#type"
:
"string"
,
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"sub-skill 名。例：`ccal` 或 `data/ccal`。"
,
"en"
:
"sub-skill name, e.g. `ccal` or `data/ccal`."
}
,
"#exec"
:
"___x_cmd_skill0_which_ \"$1\" 2>/dev/null\n"
}
,
"#tldr"
:
[
{
"cmd"
:
"x skill0 which ccal"
,
"cn"
:
"按 slug 解析"
,
"en"
:
"By slug."
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x skill0 which data/ccal"
,
"cn"
:
"按 bucket/slug 解析"
,
"en"
:
"By bucket/slug."
}
]
}
